DESCRIPTION:The UWF Chamber Music Concert Series opens its 21st season at 
 Old Christ Church in downtown Pensacola. Members of the UWF Chamber Music
  Class perform pieces written for piano\, strings\, flute\, clarinet\, ha
 rpsichord\, cello and castanet. The program includes arias\, vocal duets 
 and musical theater favorites with music by Bach\, Purcell\, Handel\, Moz
 art\, Chopin\, Lalo\, Ravel and Schubert. Admission is free and the conce
